  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Kaede: “But the procedure is exact. We all protect Millia. Tamaki, you guide. Hibiki, as anesthesiologist, carries ‘anesthesia of awareness.’ Dr. Itako operates.”",
    "ja": "Kaede「でも手順は厳格。私たち全員が、Milliaを守る。Tamaki、あなたはガイド。Hibikiが麻酔科医として\"意識の麻酔\"を担当。Dr. イタコが執刀」"
  },
